  m_text: '- Win when all reels show the same symbol on the middle line.

    - Payout
    = bet x multiplier.

    - WILD stands in for any symbol. Wins that use a WILD
    pay x2.

    - 3 or more WILDs anywhere on screen give 5 FREE SPINS with all
    wins x2.'
